Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:09.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:12.10,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:13.61,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll email you the receipts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:17.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:20.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Do you think we'll be able to \Nget copy paper restocked?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, they said it should be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.82,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,It's been a week since we started dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.13,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I want to have more...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:33.10,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,lovey-dovey moments with Tonome-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:43.20,Main - Top,,0,0,0,,YAKO TONOME
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:35.02,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Say ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:36.76,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm all drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:38.80,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:41.00,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,No one will see us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:43.22,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I-Is he gonna smooch me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:48.68,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I know we promised to keep our private \Nlives separate from work, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:52.95,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Things just happened \Nto get really busy at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:57.68,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,We do work together, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:02.35,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm so embarrassed, getting\Ndistracted like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:06.20,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Meanwhile, Tonome-san \Nis completely focused on his work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:07.80,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:12.05,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I, too, shall become a demon for work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:17.08,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I hereby swear to seal \Naway my lovey-dovey urges!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:18.47,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,SPLASH
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:18.47,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:20.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What is it, sir?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:21.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:22.63,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:25.10,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,More work? Lay it on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:28.22,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Listen... Things \Nhave been so busy lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:31.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,would it be all right to set our \Npromise aside for just a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:40.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to burden you \Nwith my impatience.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:42.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I've actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:45.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Should we go somewhere for the weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:46.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:48.96,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'd just gone and hardened\Nmy heart, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.59,0:01:52.43,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But you need punishment \Nfor breaking your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:55.30,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Y-Yako-san... please...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:57.19,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is this really necessary?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:00.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tickle tickle tickle...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:00.44,Main - Top - Italics,Kikira,0,0,0,,{M}Can I go in yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:34.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:36.23,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:38.99,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll be signing out early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can see you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:46.44,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you for seeing me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:48.64,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Of course. I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:49.92,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:52.63,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,Would you like to share a cup of tea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:53.96,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:55.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:58.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,All right. I'll call a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:03:59.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:04.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I thought maybe... \Nwe could walk together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:06.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Of course we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:16.72,Italics,Lady,0,0,0,,We're waiting to serve you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:26.21,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,H-Hey... Tonome-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:27.50,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, the train is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.45,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:37.92,Italics,{M},0,0,0,,Operation Share a Cup of Tea, \NTake 2, to go perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:41.71,Italics,{M}Operation,0,0,0,,I also had my mom check my room \Nfor cleanliness three days ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.93,0:04:40.62,Flashback - Top - Italics,Mom,0,0,0,,{\i0}Yeah, it's nice and clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.62,0:04:42.62,Flashback - Top - Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{\i0}Thank goodness! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:44.97,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I also put my laundry away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.97,0:04:46.72,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,You're clear! Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:57.61,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Will you invite me in for tea again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:02.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Or would you prefer another day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:05.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I'll make all kinds of tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:06.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:11.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I even bought sweets for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:13.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can't wait to try them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'll make the tea, so please sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:17.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let me help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:18.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:21.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're the guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:23.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:31.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I cleaned up recently, \Nbut if I missed anything, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:32.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's perfectly clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.61,0:05:34.99,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:39.22,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Sometimes I drop things\Nand don't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:41.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That does sound troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:49.16,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Wh-What do I do? And \Nwhy underwear, of all things?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:51.24,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,If you see anything \Non the floor, let me know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:55.20,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I can't tell her this. \NI'll just try not to stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:57.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, where are you sitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Th-The chair across from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:02.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll come get it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:04.47,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Don't you worry! I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:07.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Did I spill any?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:08.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:10.22,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:11.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.63,0:06:15.16,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}It's probably safest \Nto pretend I didn't see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:18.98,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}But there's no telling \Nwhen she may realize it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:22.35,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}There's also a chance someone else \Ncould come by and see it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.35,0:06:25.84,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I have to find a way to let her know \Nwithout hurting her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.72,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Time to use my detective \Nskills to their fullest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:31.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What's this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:35.66,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Looks like a handkerchief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:39.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, it {\i1}is{\i0} a handkerchief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:42.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shall we have the sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:43.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I have my tea already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.06,0:06:45.05,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:53.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:06:59.21,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:01.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:02.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:05.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm always invisible,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:07.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so it takes about two seconds for things
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:09.79,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,that enter my body \Nto become invisible too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:12.03,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:15.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It feels rude to let \Npeople see me chewing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:18.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so I tend to have to wait \Nfor it to become invisible first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:20.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:22.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,When I was a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:25.78,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,my parents told me not to chew \Nwith my mouth open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:30.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sometimes jealous of people \Nwho can enjoy their food with abandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:35.64,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,In that case, feel free to eat \Nas quickly as you want in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.63,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I can't see it anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:44.20,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Wait, you should have said \N"because we're dating!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:46.69,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}But it's embarrassing \Nto say it outright...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.01,0:07:50.85,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I still don't fully feel like \NTonome-san and I are a couple...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:52.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,W-Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:08:01.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I feel like I've done \Nsomething offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You've internalized it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:11.64,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, be careful on your way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:13.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I will. Thank you for the delicious tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:17.15,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Finding my undies \Non the floor was embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:20.24,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm just glad Tonome-san thought \Nthey were a handkerchief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:21.98,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:25.93,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shall we use first names \Nwhen in private together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:28.61,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Well... the thought makes me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:30.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:32.77,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:35.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:40.03,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm not used to it yet! \NDon't say it so often.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.21,0:08:41.62,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That was just twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:43.22,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Stop that, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:49.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:51.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:55.95,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:09:00.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're just so charming, \NI was thinking about kissing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:06.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Sighted and visible people make eye \Ncontact to judge the timing of a kiss,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:09.98,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but I realize that's not \Npossible for either of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:12.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,H-How should we do it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.45,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Should we come up with a signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:17.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh? Does that mean I can kiss you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:27.71,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Did you just touch my forehead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:29.50,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:34.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Jarashi-san, could you handle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:34.76,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:37.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Kikira-san, how's the research coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:42.37,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, did something nice happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:46.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,There's a spring in your step \Nand in your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:49.99,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Actually, I just got a new suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:52.99,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, yeah. Never seen that one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:53.90,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Does it look good on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:57.41,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,How should I know? You're invisible, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:04.08,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I can hear in his voice that he's hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:08.80,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I want to help, but \NI don't know about clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:13.92,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I dunno squat about clothes, \Nbut it's got a good vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:16.82,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, good point! The vibe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:19.78,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yeah, it suits you well, in that sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:22.93,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,And the dull green color \Nis nice and different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:26.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's right! I really liked the color!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:28.68,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I get it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:31.81,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You've both got great taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:33.10,Main - Top - Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I can't participate in this topic,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:37.28,Main - Top - Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}but I'm glad that he's so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:38.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:42.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I think the suit fabric \Nhas a nice feel, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:44.09,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you like to touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:55.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It feels very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:57.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It sure does! Soft, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:02.78,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're so cute today! Like a little boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:04.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:08.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Do you like fashion, Tonome-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:11.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about fashion, \Nbut I do like clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:15.97,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's the only way I can \Nexpress myself, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:21.56,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Speaking of, I've been wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:24.56,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,The thing where invisible people \Nmake their clothing invisible...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:25.99,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:31.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It appears our bodies produce a substance \Nthat makes us invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.16,0:11:33.78,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Full invisibility is like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:40.90,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We can flip a switch in our bodies \Nto turn it on and off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:43.74,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Doesn't make sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:47.26,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,If we held hands, \Nwould my hand disappear too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:49.99,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shall we try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:56.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It doesn't work \Non living things, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:02.44,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}He linked his fingers in mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:05.71,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Sure must be nice \Nto be invisible, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.71,0:12:06.82,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Real convenient!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:12.86,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Though legally, we're not allowed to \Nuse full invisibility in public spaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:14.13,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.13,0:12:14.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:18.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I do have a special license \Nfor it for my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:23.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but when I'm invisible on the street, \Npeople tend to bump into me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:27.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so I avoid it in public when possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:30.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It can be quite dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:32.65,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'm picking up what he's laying down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:39.61,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:42.88,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Oh! It's been a while, Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:44.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:46.66,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I brought my mother today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:49.65,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,What a lovely shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:52.70,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Hello! I'm Shizuka's mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:55.45,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,My daughter says she loved your shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:58.71,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Really? I'm so happy to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:01.58,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,I've never made my own tea before!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:03.09,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:04.35,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:08.25,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,{M}I wonder if Yako-san has told her \Nabout Tonome-san yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:11.37,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,{M}She told me recently that they \Nare officially dating, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.36,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:18.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Light-san! Karma-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:19.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:20.56,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Nice to see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:23.19,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about all that trouble before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:26.40,Main,Light,0,0,0,,It's teacake. I hope \Nyou'll enjoy it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:28.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:32.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you. Please join us for tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:34.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll make it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.42,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Yako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:40.25,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I hear you and Tonome-chan are official?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:43.88,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't talk about \Nthat in their workplace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:46.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:51.15,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Turbo cute! I'm fallin' for her myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:54.88,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:14:01.02,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,{M}She may not have told her, \Nso I should probably avoid mentioning him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:03.16,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Yako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:05.18,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,You and the BF hitched yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:06.32,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.25,0:14:10.31,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Marriage is a long way off for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:12.15,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Aw, for reals?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.15,0:14:14.40,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,{M}It's okay, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:17.26,Main,Light,0,0,0,,It's much too soon for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:20.63,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Elves may be long-lived, \Nbut humans have a different sense of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:23.52,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,I do wonder what her boyfriend is like!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:25.97,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,He's one transparent guy, \NI can tell you that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:28.13,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Well, that much is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:30.16,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,I can't wait to meet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:32.98,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,But I had no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:36.96,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,So Shizuka has a boyfriend now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.00,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Let me meet him sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:46.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Do you have that information \Nyet, Shizu— Yako-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:50.46,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Aki— Tonome-san, I just sent it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:53.74,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Just use your first names already, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:57.03,Main,Kirara,0,0,0,,They're probably trying \Nto keep it out of the workplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:59.04,Main,Kirara,0,0,0,,It's not our place to comment on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:02.69,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,That's their call, \Nbut it's just so dang obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.47,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yet if I ask, they deflect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.77,0:15:07.32,Flashback,Jarashi,0,0,0,,You guys official yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.80,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,That's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:15.68,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Having to dance around it \Nis just exhausting for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:18.11,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:21.44,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Hey, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:26.64,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,It's obvious that you're dating, \Nso call each other what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:27.44,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:32.87,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Didn't you just say it wasn't our place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:35.53,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I'm tired of dancing around it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:37.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:38.59,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I feel kind of bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:39.94,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,H-Hey, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:41.92,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Nothing for you to apologize for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:44.24,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,If you want to hide it,\Ntry harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:44.77,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.77,0:15:47.50,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Kikira! Have a little tact!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.22,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,What else was I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:53.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:56.62,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Hello. Is now a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:58.39,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, Madaraito-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:16:00.19,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I've got a job for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:02.44,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,MEETING ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:04.88,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,It's about a case I'm working on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.12,0:16:05.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:08.76,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'd like to get some information \Nthat will help my client.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:11.53,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'll come by with my \Nclient in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:13.55,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,so you can get the details from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:16.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Of course. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:17.55,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'll see you soon, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.71,0:16:20.24,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,By the way, Tonome-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:20.91,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:23.51,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I love the color of your suit today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:25.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Y-You get it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:28.92,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Yes! I'd love to try out \Nmore things like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:32.08,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,but we lawyers don't get to \Nplay around with our fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:33.18,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:38.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What about getting adventurous \Nwith pocket squares and accessories?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.05,0:16:39.44,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,That's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:42.48,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, you're brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:46.90,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,Madaraito-san's such a cheerful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:49.94,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,He always notices little things \Nto praise about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:54.40,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Well, everyone, good luck with your work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:16:57.35,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I left a souvenir with Tonome-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:16:58.90,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.90,0:17:00.95,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I hope there's a Churun in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:04.22,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Got it! I'll remember that for next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.22,0:17:05.66,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:08.64,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Well, be careful on your way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:11.72,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Tonome-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:14.55,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Thanks for always looking after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:16.30,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,O-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:21.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Your law offices have been \Na great help to us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:23.74,Italics,Madaraito,0,0,0,,{M}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:28.81,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Hey, Daichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:32.91,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Haven't you told your agency \Nthat I'm your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:35.32,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I just assumed they all knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.32,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Do I gotta tell 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:41.92,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'd like them to call me if \Nsomething happens to you at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:44.28,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,We see each other at work too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:46.22,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,It's important to make a good impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:50.09,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,We'll tell 'em then. Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:53.35,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'm coming back to \NTonome-san's agency next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:55.11,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,So we'll do it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:56.17,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,We'd better!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:58.02,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I get it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:00.04,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:06.50,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Anyway, this guy's my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:09.53,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Thanks for taking such \Ngood care of my Daichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:11.29,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Madaraito-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:13.32,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,And here. For you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:13.35,Main - Top,SIGN,0,0,0,,CHURUN
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:15.87,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.87,0:18:18.45,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you even see in Kikira?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:20.28,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,You're going there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:22.70,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,We started dating in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:23.89,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,In the mountains—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:23.88,Main - Top,Kikira,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.51,0:18:28.73,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You did what you came for, so leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:32.02,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Sorry. Daichi hates mixing his work \Nand his private life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.01,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,I'll leave it at that for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:34.72,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}The mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:35.72,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}The mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.95,0:18:37.06,Italics,Jarashi/Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I'm so curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:39.52,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:56.62,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:59.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:02.03,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was thinking of dropping by...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.71,0:19:05.33,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-It's just a cold, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:07.29,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:12.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I would like... if you were here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:14.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll be there right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.39,0:19:15.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:22.05,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I let him spoil me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:26.31,Flashback,Yukari,0,0,0,,It's easy to catch cold \Nwhen the seasons change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.31,0:19:28.01,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:31.24,Flashback,Yukari,0,0,0,,I'll handle the housework, \Nso you take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:31.99,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:36.15,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I forgot my mom was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:39.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Mom, that phone call was...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:42.05,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:44.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Huh, she's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:45.90,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Did she go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:48.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,C-Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:52.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You really did come right by!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:54.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I happened to be close by when I called.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:19:59.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can't catch human colds, \Nso you don't need to wear a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:01.55,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:02.19,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.19,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here, I'll make you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:06.26,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:08.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You need egg rice porridge\N at times like these!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:11.05,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,My favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:20.80,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}The sounds of Akira-san cooking...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.72,0:20:24.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The egg rice porridge is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.85,0:20:29.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Smells delicious! I assume, anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.12,0:20:31.87,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's hard when you've got \Na stuffy nose, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:35.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's hot, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:36.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:38.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:43.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.79,0:20:49.05,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um... could you feed me... maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:53.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe that's a little too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:55.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.22,0:20:57.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll blow on it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:58.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.99,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You don't have to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:04.19,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. Open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.85,0:21:06.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Say ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:11.23,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:14.61,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Was it too hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.19,0:21:17.01,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,These are convulsions of joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:19.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:26.10,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Wait, did he just get on my bed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:35.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You had rice on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:42.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:43.72,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,I'm Shizuka's mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:44.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.71,0:21:47.90,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I was hanging out the wash!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:50.96,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,I was trying to stay hidden \Nso I didn't interrupt, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:56.11,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Just give me a minute \Nto get out of your hair, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.11,0:21:57.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You don't have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:22:01.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm sorry \NI didn't introduce myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.24,0:22:04.84,Main,Yukari,0,0,0,,Not at all! Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.97,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 3: DATING FOR A WEEK\N TO BE CONTINUED
